Depends: openjdk-21, axel, xz-utils, ca-certificates
Section: android
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/HomuHomu833/android-sdk-custom
Description: Android SDK 37.0.0 for Termux (aarch64 and x86_64)
 Custom-built Android SDK with platform-tools, build-tools 37.0.0,
 and cmdline-tools 19.0. Downloads the matching Termux build and
 extracts it to $PREFIX/opt/android-sdk.
